# Scenario S3 tui-splash (creative): launch the omp TUI, let it render, quit. Header injected.
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "omp --no-session"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+C
Sleep 800ms
Type "exit"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
